	(text "halo revision A. Board Ø26.00 x 0.60 mm, 4 layers, three 26 deg keying notches at 0/120/240 deg to R12.60 (lane M, design.py). Ø31.87 mm is the SHELL max OD at z=4.339, NOT the board."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 12.7 388.62 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "3a88dfd6-42fb-50bc-b9c6-834e703b2040")
	)
	(text "LAYOUT RULES THAT TRAVEL WITH THIS SHEET (Nordic Figure 175, verbatim): C18's ground connects ONLY to pin 32 (VSS_PA) on the top layer. C19's ground MUST be isolated from every ground layer except the bottom. U1 pad 49 MUST tie to VSS pins 32 and 44."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 12.7 391.16 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "39d267eb-e798-5b06-8ea6-045ad3111c77")
	)
	(text "PLACEHOLDERS, not results: the pi network C20/L10/C21 and the NFC tuning C24/C25 are seeded values awaiting ce-rf's measured S11 and coil inductance on the real Ø26.00 copper."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 12.7 393.7 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "cb1e58f0-bb82-5672-9df4-7110b635c0a2")
	)
	(text "HEIGHT DELTA, open against lane M: a QFN48 is 0.85 mm and the stack allows 0.400 mm on the top face inside Ø21.2 and about 0.578 mm on the bottom face over the cell. Short by ~0.32 mm. L1 (0.9 mm) and X1 (0.9 mm) are bound by the same delta."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 12.7 396.24 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "c796def4-947e-5fee-ba0b-b489008f8461")
	)
	(text "C14-C17 ARE NOT FITTED. The nRF54L's on-die CAPVALUE load capacitors are used. Fitting these as well double-loads the crystal; populate ONLY with the internal ones disabled."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 12.7 398.78 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "299ac019-9c3c-5b27-82d8-501d727331ea")
	)
	(text "TEST ACCESS (block 10): TP1/TP2 are VDD FORCE and SENSE and TP3/TP4 are GND FORCE and SENSE - four wires, because sleep current here is single-digit microamps and a two-wire reading measures the probe. FID1/FID2 are ASYMMETRIC: a 26 mm circle has no datum and without them every pad position is a guess."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 12.7 401.32 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "4a99d69b-e15d-59e8-9d9b-862c5b778395")
	)
	(text "IPC-A-610 ACCEPTANCE CLASS 2. Class 3 is for equipment whose failure cannot be tolerated - life support, avionics - and halo is not that. Class 1 is general consumer electronics where cosmetics do not matter, and a product with a DULT safety obligation and a user-replaceable cell is not that either. The AOI recipe is built from this line, so it is recorded here rather than left for the factory to choose."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 12.7 403.86 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "35955d30-abf7-5e92-9379-626522d71306")
	)
	(text "THERE IS NO SPI NOR FLASH. The GD25LQ32E first drawn here is a 1.65-2.0 V part and this board's only rail is a raw 3.0 V coin cell. Block 6 carries the argument; the firmware is 13,164 bytes, 1.27 % of the SoC's own 1 MB."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 12.7 406.4 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
